.TH MX-CONKY 1 "2026-07-20" "MX Linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mx-conky \- configure and manage Conky configurations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mx-conky
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mx-conky
is a graphical manager for Conky configurations tested and prepared for MX Linux. It provides a starting point for users who want to display system information on the desktop without manually maintaining Conky configuration files.
.PP
Use the main window to browse available configurations, preview them, start or stop a configuration, and manage the configurations available to the user. The application uses
.I ~/.conky/
for user configurations; do not place a configuration in the traditional
.I ~/.conkyrc
location when using MX Conky.
.PP
Conky configurations may use Lua and may display system monitoring, music, email, weather, or update information. Review a configuration before enabling it, especially when it runs external commands.
.SH OPTIONS
This application has no documented command-line options. The graphical interface provides all operations.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.conky/
Per-user Conky configurations.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/mx-conky
Installed HTML help, images, license, and changelog documentation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR conky (1)
.SH AUTHOR
MX Linux contributors.
